=== load
--- calls
python3
  <TMP>/w-manual/tree/collectors/manual/load.py
  --bronze-dir
  <TMP>/w-manual/xdgdata/wealthdb/manual
  --silver-db
  <TMP>/w-manual/xdgdata/wealthdb/manual/manual.db
