=== download
--- calls
exit: 0
--- stdout
--- stderr
manual: no-op. This collector has no source to fetch from — the CSVs are
the source of truth. Maintain the CSVs by hand in the data dir (default
$XDG_DATA_HOME/wealthdb/manual/): positions.csv, valuations.csv, and
optionally accounts.csv to give positions their own tax sleeve and
management style, cost_basis.csv for capital paid in over time, and
exits.csv for what a position was sold for — then run `./manual load` to
validate them and rebuild the silver. See README.md for the columns and how
to maintain them.
